{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118678","id":3544538668,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7TRV4s","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118678","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118678.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118678.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118678","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118678/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118678/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118678/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6409ce6bb646e2c73362771b5e5e172de42a5a59","number":118678,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix race in `RefCounted::unreference()`","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When two threads unreference() a RefCounted Object at the same time there's a potential race.\r\n\r\nThread A sees rc_val == 1, enters the if() block.\r\nThread B sees rc_val == 0, enters the if() block.\r\n\r\nThread A gets scheduled out, or is simply scheduled on a slower core and Thread B finishes, returning die = true. Thread B then frees the Object.\r\n\r\nSome time during or after ~Object() Thread A wakes up and tries to call methods on the Object, which is either destroyed or in the process of being destroyed, leading to a use-after-free.\r\n\r\nWe fix the problem by counting how many threads are currently inside the critical section, and blocking returning die = true as long as there are still other threads potentially alive.\r\n\r\nTested by running with --test and by opening and playing various public and private Godot projects.\r\n\r\nThis fixes #115173","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com